    "## 3. The two fixes, demonstrated\n",
    "\n",
    "### 3a. Input gain\n",
    "\n",
    "Build the same network twice \u2014 flat `W_in` versus `W_in` scaled by $2\\zeta\\omega^2$ \u2014 and look at\n",
    "the magnitude of everything."
